FDC"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1702216297532935", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824671_1702216300866268_5395440434917968934_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dh4YDc_tqlwQ7kNvwHEh_wR&_nc_oc=Adpl-5FPhYnRCGxuk4xZpMoJSott3LfEQwAz5BD6p4FlIpeld0KWaOhscWp4kaZZ7as&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQIwNb08ke2aab7_6mVC-QaCM7AfrSlBsxJlH8YpQbjYA&oe=6AF1E59C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Scuba Diving Game: Deep Sea Adventure", "keywords": ["scubadiving", "deepsea", "underwatergame", "oceanadventure", "divingsimulator"], "long_description": "Dive into an unforgettable underwater journey in Scuba Diving Game: Deep Sea Adventure! Explore the mysterious deep sea, discover hidden treasures, and experience the thrill of scuba diving through beautiful ocean environments filled with colorful marine life.\n\nSwim through coral reefs, ancient shipwrecks, underwater caves, and the deep ocean while completing exciting missions. Search for rare treasures, avoid dangerous sea creatures, and improve your diving skills as you explore the wonders beneath the waves.\n\nFeatures\n\ud83c\udf0a Explore stunning deep sea locations\n\ud83e\udd3f Realistic scuba diving gameplay\n\ud83d\udc20 Discover colorful fish and amazing marine life\n\ud83d\udc8e Find hidden treasures and valuable collectibles\n\ud83d\udea2 Explore sunken ships and underwater caves\n\ud83c\udfaf Complete fun and challenging diving missions\n\ud83c\udfae Smooth and easy-to-learn controls\n\ud83c\udf0d Beautiful 3D underwater environments\n\ud83d\udcf6 Play anytime, even offline\n\nWhether you love ocean exploration, treasure hunting, or relaxing underwater adventures, Scuba Diving Game: Deep Sea Adventure offers an exciting experience for players of all ages.", "short_description": "Dive into an exciting scuba diving game, explore the deep sea, find treasures, and discover amazing underwater worlds. 